70","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo for Next Fest – Partial bug fixes","summary":"Bug FixesFixed the issue where dialogue in the warehouse would freeze and become unresponsive.Fixed font display problems affecting some localized languages.Fixed the resolution selection failing to appear on certain devices.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:37:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035681","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4770970-1846651706695137","game_id":"steam-4770970","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo for Next Fest – Partial bug fixes","summary":"Bug FixesFixed the bug where the warehouse list disappearsFixed occasional controller input loss in the hangar menu outside matchesFixed incorrect button prompt displaysFixed the issue where you cannot exit after unplugging the controller on the result screen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:55:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4770970-1846651706688965","game_id":"steam-4770970","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo Update","summary":"New ContentAdded two new stages: a high-difficulty boss fight and a low-difficulty meteor interception missionWarehouse function added, materials can now be soldAdded two artillery support skillsAdded one new tactical equipmentDifferentiated thruster VFX for different mechs, added visual effect for reverse boost thrustersAdded in-combat NPC dialogueCamera shake and controller vibration added; both can be toggled separately in settingsMissile pods on enemy warships are now destructibleBoss Mandal","occurred_at":null,"p